<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Baoba: It’s you!\nThat musta been a long trip.\rWelcome to the Safari Zone!\nIt ain’t been open long, but you\fcan still have all the fun!\rMake yourself at home in my safari!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Baoba: I’mma keep upgradin’ my safari.\nI’ll hit your Pokégear if I\fswitch anythin’ up.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Safari Zone...\rIt make me feel like I’m in\nanother country.\fGimme a weird feelin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">..................\n(I ain’t a talker.)</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">KANGASKHAN: ..................</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This Safari Zone go crazy!\rI just kept chasin’ homies!\nMy JIGGLYPUFF got salty though.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">JIGGLYPUFF: Puu pupuu.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Safari, safari,\nit’s SO much fun.\rSafari, safari,\nso interestin’, huh!\rSo many homies waitin’ on us!\r...That’s a song I made up.\nI sing it in the Safari Zone.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Safari Ball go flyin’ under the\nblue sky. Sweat go drippin’ to\fcelebrate a friendship.\rI love the Safari Zone!\r...I made a whole jingle outta it.\nYou think anybody would cop it?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I decided to sell homie drinks.\rThis is new to me, but I’mma\ndo my best...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, you tryna buy somethin’?\nCan you wait while I set up?\rOne sec...\f..................\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BUTTERFREE: Flu flu.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">There’s mad homies to pick from,\nbut NOTHIN’ beat how cute\fSLOWPOKE is.\rPeople always say I look like one!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWPOKE: ...Yawn?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I always wanted to catch my first\nhomie at the Safari Zone.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You prob’ly think there’s some\nhigh-tech system for\fcustomizin’ the Safari Zone, right?\rThe real truth is...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Arrrgh...\nI’m SO tired...\fThis job take everythin’ outta you...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0133_D47_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Safari Zone\rWhere Everything Is Thrillin’.\nPull up and experience\fthe wild!</language>
	</row>
</body>
